1. DEFINITIONS

"Software" means the source code, object code, documentation, and other files
made available with this license, including modifications and derivative works.
It excludes third-party components and model weights governed by other terms.

"Licensor" means the copyright owner offering the Software under this license.

"You" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights under this
license. If You act for an organization, "You" includes that organization and
its Corporate Group.

"Corporate Group" means You and every entity that directly or indirectly
controls, is controlled by, or is under common control with You. "Control"
means ownership of more than fifty percent of voting interests or the direct or
indirect power to direct management or policies, whether through ownership,
agreement, or otherwise.

"Personal Use" means use by an individual solely on their own behalf for
learning, private experimentation, hobbies, or private entertainment, and not
for compensation or for the benefit of an organization.

"Noncommercial Use" means use that is not intended for commercial advantage,
monetary compensation, internal business operations, a paid product or service,
consulting, hosted service, or the benefit of a commercial customer.

"Commercial Use" means any use other than Personal Use or Noncommercial Use,
including internal business use, production use, consulting, offering a hosted
or managed service, or including the Software in a paid product or service.

"Worldwide Gross Annual Revenue" means the Corporate Group's consolidated
worldwide revenue from all sources during its most recently completed fiscal
year, before costs or deductions. Intercompany revenue is counted only once.
VAT, sales taxes collected for a government, refunds, and customer pass-through
funds are excluded. Revenue in another currency is converted to euros using the
European Central Bank annual average reference rate for that fiscal year. A
Corporate Group without a completed fiscal year must use a good-faith annualized
estimate based on all available operating results and signed contracts.

"Eligible Small Business" means a Corporate Group whose Worldwide Gross Annual
Revenue is not more than EUR 1,000,000.

