4. LOSS OF SMALL-BUSINESS ELIGIBILITY

If Your Corporate Group ceases to be an Eligible Small Business because of
revenue, merger, acquisition, reorganization, or change of control, You may
continue the previously permitted Commercial Use for ninety days after the
later of the eligibility change or the date it can reasonably be determined.
Before that period ends, You must obtain a separate written commercial license
or stop all Commercial Use. Licensor is not obligated to offer any particular
price or commercial terms.

5. COMPLIANCE

You must keep records reasonably sufficient to determine eligibility for three
years. On reasonable written request no more than once per year, You will
provide a signed statement confirming whether You remain eligible. Licensor
